  "body": "Perfectly positioned within one of Gulf Harbours most exclusive cliffside cul-de-sacs, this remarkable residence enjoys sparkling sea views, peaceful reserve walks at your doorstep, and a lifestyle defined by privacy, tranquillity and natural beauty.\r\n\r\nA true statement in design, this magnificent home celebrates exceptional craftsmanship, majestic proportions and understated luxury. Every detail has been thoughtfully considered to create a residence that is both timeless and welcoming.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step through the impressive front entrance, an extraordinary sense of scale unfolds before you. Epic proportions, soaring ceilings, oversized windows and an elegant sweeping staircase create an unforgettable first impression, while natural light fills every corner of the home.\r\n\r\nTimber flooring, soft neutral tones and beautifully balanced interiors are complemented by rich natural textures, stone and marble accents, creating a sophisticated yet relaxed environment that feels effortlessly luxurious.\r\n\r\nDesigned with flexibility in mind, the thoughtfully considered floor plan is perfectly suited to large families, multi-generational living or those who simply appreciate generous space.\r\n\r\nThe stunning atrium-style entrance hall welcomes you to the ground floor, where internal access to the immense three-car garage is complemented by a spacious second living area, two generous bedrooms and a beautifully appointed bathroom - ideal for extended family, guests or independent living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home opens to an extraordinary living environment. A magnificent designer kitchen anchors expansive open-plan dining and family spaces, creating the perfect setting for everyday living and entertaining on a grand scale. Walls of glass frame the surrounding landscape, while effortless flow extends to outdoor entertaining areas where sea views provide a breathtaking backdrop.\r\n\r\nThe private bedroom wing offers a luxurious master retreat complete with a beautifully appointed ensuite and walk-in-wardrobe, accompanied by two further generous bedrooms, a stylish family bathroom and a separate guest powder room.\r\n\r\nFully fenced and securely gated from the road, the property also offers extensive off-street parking for additional vehicles, a boat or campervan, adding further practicality to this exceptional family home.\r\n\r\nConstructed with treated timber framing and a cavity plaster system, this remarkable residence offers complete confidence alongside outstanding lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a residence of remarkable scale, exceptional quality and enduring elegance in one of the area’s most tightly held coastal locations.",
